WEBVTT

00:00:28.997 --> 00:00:31.497
of the health-care systems
around the world.

00:00:32.030 --> 00:00:33.530
And, you know, if I may say so,

00:00:33.563 --> 00:00:37.830
the developing world showed that it had
better primary-care capabilities

00:00:37.863 --> 00:00:39.797
than the western hemisphere.

00:00:40.097 --> 00:00:43.263
And this actually has helped them
cope with the disease

00:00:43.297 --> 00:00:45.097
I think a little better

00:00:45.130 --> 00:00:48.497
than what the Western world
has struggled with.

00:00:48.997 --> 00:00:51.530
And it also pointed out that, you know,

00:00:51.563 --> 00:00:55.630
you cannot be looking after
your own small populations

00:00:55.663 --> 00:00:59.097
and forget about others
who are in the neighborhood

00:00:59.130 --> 00:01:00.997
because you're not safe.